        "title": "The graph below gives information about how much people in the United States and the United Kingdom spend on petrol. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QQzTd67hHoozRkxPKfZl6aWAgTf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QpD4dwKBWokWcYxQuOplQwOmgSc\"><em><strong>The graph below gives information about how much people in the United States and the United Kingdom spend on petrol. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "sort": 1,
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>&nbsp;IELTS Writing Task 1 - Petrol expenditure across income groups in &nbsp;the US and the UK</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CYVsdh3adoPqlLxBlWcl4gUVgwd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/task-1-line-charts\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Giới thiệu dạng Line Graphs</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WzbldxsHvoEmSdxHZSalPqZUg4b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Petrol expenditure across income groups in &nbsp;the US and the UK y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả tỷ lệ phần trăm thu nhập hộ gia đ&igrave;nh được chi cho xăng của người l&aacute;i xe ở <strong data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"480\">Mỹ v&agrave; Anh</strong>, chia theo <strong data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"511\">5 nh&oacute;m thu nhập</strong> (từ ngh&egrave;o nhất đến gi&agrave;u nhất).</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLFYdUG36o4o85xAOPBlI161gNd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/170/ielts-writing-task-1-aim-6570?collection=lesson&amp;item=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tả số liệu \"tương đối\"</a></strong></span><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span><strong> </strong>trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UEs9dlyx2okrTPxmScBl9NDNgwh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Petrol expenditure across income groups in &nbsp;the US and the UK với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: tỉ lệ thu nhập sử dụng cho xăng - 2 quốc gia - 3 nh&oacute;m thu nhập (ngh&egrave;o - trung b&igrave;nh - gi&agrave;u).</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SMCAdCHAAo2jQNxu5Fplz84fgmb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Line Graphs</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr;<strong> </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-line\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng LINE</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BPLHdZ1AWonL9Zx1HAklrflQgAd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrEfdeA32oruHJxpv0CltBnPg7d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FCkCdAPs9oUNGVxxTwhlgylYgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UnG2dXTj8oL2X8xuX3Rlt6d3g6b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>c&oacute; những xu hướng tr&aacute;i ngược giữa hai quốc gia</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jektdtz6qoRvzfxDwTGl0Vy3g8d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: &nbsp;</strong>Ở Mỹ, c&aacute;c hộ gia đ&igrave;nh ngh&egrave;o hơn chi ti&ecirc;u một tỷ lệ phần trăm cao hơn thu nhập của họ cho xăng, trong khi ở Anh, những người gi&agrave;u c&oacute; hơn ph&acirc;n bổ nhiều thu nhập hơn cho chi ph&iacute; nhi&ecirc;n liệu.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pi8FdlqEUoy6aGxXSiglpGrIgeh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> United States</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IrAwd9JxtorDimxNXDOlx9MTgjb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mv4ydageCozWmrxlQq1lediYgyh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">M&ocirc; tả nh&oacute;m ngh&egrave;o nhất</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;</span><em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">(chi ti&ecirc;u từ 3.7% đến 4.8% thu nhập của họ cho xăng dầu</span></em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><em>).</em></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZtjIdTLXno4SoPxSdvYlmqRJgjb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">M&ocirc; tả nh&oacute;m c&oacute; thu nhập trung b&igrave;nh</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;</span><em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">(con số giảm xuống khoảng 3.8-4.8%</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">)</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">.</span></em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WAqKdWGlYoOAo0ximCrlWu3ZgE2\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả nh&oacute;m gi&agrave;u nhất&nbsp;</strong><em>(giảm th&ecirc;m xuống khoảng 2.3-3.8%)&nbsp;</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WAqKdWGlYoOAo0ximCrlWu3ZgE2\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>Điều n&agrave;y cho thấy chi ti&ecirc;u xăng dầu l&agrave; g&aacute;nh nặng t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh nhiều hơn cho người Mỹ c&oacute; thu nhập thấp.</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TjNPd6TvCoVV5Hxq9TQlhCehgNb\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TjNPd6TvCoVV5Hxq9TQlhCehgNb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BbzKdPgEyoLpsjx7kYIlQ0Q1g4g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S0l8dkGHhoeVf1xdcuPlhdbRgHd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YFozdR2IuosAukxF4wqlDPA0gnh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: United Kingdom</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZFQdbZvYoA2RXxrWTdlYAEJgtc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mv4ydageCozWmrxlQq1lediYgyh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">M&ocirc; tả nh&oacute;m ngh&egrave;o nhất</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;</span><em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">(chỉ chi ti&ecirc;u một phần nhỏ thu nhập của họ cho xăng dầu, dao động từ 0.4-2.5%</span></em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><em>).</em></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZtjIdTLXno4SoPxSdvYlmqRJgjb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">M&ocirc; tả nh&oacute;m c&oacute; thu nhập trung b&igrave;nh</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;</span><em><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">(tăng l&ecirc;n khoảng 2.5-3.8%</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">)</span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">.</span></em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WAqKdWGlYoOAo0ximCrlWu3ZgE2\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả nh&oacute;m gi&agrave;u nhất&nbsp;</strong><em>(tiếp tục tăng đến 3.3-3.8%)&nbsp;</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WAqKdWGlYoOAo0ximCrlWu3ZgE2\" style=\"font-style: italic;\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>Điều n&agrave;y cho thấy những người c&oacute; thu nhập cao hơn ở Anh chi ti&ecirc;u tỷ lệ lớn hơn thu nhập của họ cho nhi&ecirc;n liệu.</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TN6Fd9B0PohTNjxAWltlSG3sgUg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgpOdgFa5orVtdxiKOPliFF8gih\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RYRddABRToQrqNxG0fSl7OrOg5c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YdvRdtEEMoe1nqxSg4NlhL6GgQf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WIUnd6WAUoXWJSx4xA3lyHevgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GzVudZspKo0jPLxbMunl1LTAgjc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn diễn đạt <span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\"</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">chiếm tỷ lệ lớn hơn</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\", m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể sử dụng c&aacute;c c&aacute;ch diễn đạt sau để đa dạng c&acirc;u từ hơn nh&eacute;!</span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TuK9dgT5AoBU6KxgM0plA894gId\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NvYsd4I6NoNXSxxNnTolfHG5gee\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Overall, Americans <strong>devote a larger share of</strong> their income to fuel than Britons at almost every income level, and the two nations exhibit contrasting patterns by income.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2443,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>The line graph compares the proportion of income that drivers in the United States and the United Kingdom spend on petrol across different income groups.</p>",
            "question_id": 20379,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2444,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, there are contrasting trends between the two countries. In the US, poorer households spend a higher percentage of their income on petrol, while in the UK, wealthier individuals allocate more of their income to fuel costs.</p>",
            "question_id": 20379,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2445,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>Looking at the United States, the poorest group spends between 3.7% and 4.8% of their income on petrol, which is the highest proportion among all groups. This figure then decreases for middle-income earners to around 3.8-4.8%, before dropping further for the richest group to approximately 2.3-3.8%. This shows that petrol expenditure represents a greater financial burden for lower-income Americans.</p>",
            "question_id": 20379,
